# /root/Startup/1bit-lemonade-webapp - open the chat screen when the desktop starts.
#
# Cycle 17 item 9: the XDG desktop entry (/etc/xdg/autostart/1bit-lemonade-webapp.desktop) is the right place by
# the desktop spec and /root/.jwmrc does run xdg_autostart.sh, but JWM's own startup directory is the hook Puppy
# actually exercises (/root/.xinitrc runs every /root/Startup/* before it execs the window manager). Both are
# installed on purpose - 1bit-lemonade-webapp's own /tmp/1bit-webapp-opened guard makes the second one a no-op,
# and a demo box that reaches the desktop with no browser open is the failure this cannot have.
exec /usr/local/bin/1bit-lemonade-webapp
